## ✅ Conclusion

This project demonstrates an end-to-end machine learning approach for detecting fraudulent financial transactions.

By combining **EDA, SMOTE, Logistic Regression, Random Forest, and multiple evaluation metrics**, the project addresses the challenges of highly imbalanced fraud detection data.

The approach can be further improved through **hyperparameter tuning, threshold optimization, advanced feature engineering, real-time deployment, and continuous model monitoring**.
